#* {{quote-text|en|year=1725|translator=w:John Dryden|title={{w|Virgil}}’s Husbandry, or an Essay on the {{w|Georgics}}|location=London|section=Book 2, p. 37|url=https://catalog.hathitrust.org/Record/001810665
